>终于更新了，直接一大堆瑟瑟天子捏！（捧脸+星星眼）</span></div><div class=\"div-img\" style=\"color:rgb(0,0,0);font-size:14px;\"><span style=\"color:rgb(0,0,0);font-size:14px;\"><br></span></div><div class=\"div-img\" style=\"color:rgb(0,0,0);font-size:14px;\"><span style=\"color: rgb(0, 176, 240); font-size: 16px; font-weight: bold;\">这里就是说一句：和谐的是国际端，就是谷歌下载的，没和谐的就是TAP，或者其他非谷歌下载的端口，这2个都是互通，再问自傻！魔改就算了，真心没意思，而且还每次更新都会把修改的文件更新了，你打了魔改有些天子还不显示，而且魔改好像都不更新了！</span><br></div><div class=\"div-img\" style=\"color:rgb(0,0,0);font-size:14px;\"><br></div><div class=\"div-img\" style=\"color:rgb(0,0,0);font-size:14px;\">这不是<span style=\"color: rgb(255, 0, 0); font-weight: bold; text-decoration-line: underline;\"><span style=\"font-size:20px;\">攻略！攻略！攻略！</span></span></div><div style=\"color:rgb(0,0,0);font-size:14px;\"><div style=\"\"></div><span style=\"font-size:16px;\"><div style=\"\">偶看到很多萌新玩这个游戏的初心都是为了柰子为了瑟度，所以偶就写这篇东西，看攻略之前都是问要不要留，能不能用，老实说，如果不是为了打乱斗，谁去升3星，4星的天子，如果不是好看，谁留着碍地方呢~所以，试问，谁会拒绝好看的天子呢~有很多人说偶是LSP，偶在这里声明一下，偶并不老。</div><div style=\"\"></div></span><div style=\"\"><br style=\"\"></div><div style=\"\"><div contenteditable=\"false\" class=\"title-model-wrapper title1\" style=\"margin:0px1px10px;width:calc(100%-6px);background:rgb(0,182,79);\"><div contenteditable=\"true\" class=\"title-p\" style=\"font-weight:700;font-size:14px;width:auto;color:rgb(255,255,255);\"><span style=\"font-size:20px;\">3星</span></div></div><br style=\"\"></div></div><div style=\"color:rgb(0,0,0);font-size:14px;\"><div class=\"div-img\" style=\"\"><img data-real=\"//cdnimg-v2.gamekee.com/images/www/1630427090964_93457861.png\" src=\"//cdnimg-v2.gamekee.com/images/www/1630427090964_93457861.png\" style=\"\" data-width=\"835\" data-height=\"343\"></div>因为WIKI里面没有3星的图鉴，所以偶直接在自己的游戏图鉴截图，涩度都是偶觉得可以，当然每个人的喜好都不同，偶只能列出偶觉得可以的，你说自己喜欢3星机器人，偶也没办法呀~</div><div style=\"color:rgb(0,0,0);font-size:14px;\"><br style=\"\"></div><div style=\"color:rgb(0,0,0);font-size:14px;\"><div contenteditable=\"false\" class=\"title-model-wrapper title1\" style=\"margin:0px1px10px;width:calc(100%-6px);background:rgb(0,182,79);\"><div contenteditable=\"true\" class=\"title-p\" style=\"font-weight:700;font-size:14px;width:auto;color:rgb(255,255,255);\"><span style=\"font-size:20px;\"><span style=\"\">4星</span></span></div></div><br style=\"\"></div><div style=\"color:rgb(0,0,0);font-size:14px;\"><div class=\"div-img\" style=\"\"><img data-real=\"//cdnimg-v2.gamekee.com/images/www/1630428613501_50348553.png\" src=\"//cdnimg-v2.gamekee.com/images/www/1630428613501_50348553.png\" style=\"\" data-width=\"677\" data-height=\"516\"></div><div class=\"div-img\" style=\"\"><br style=\"\"></div><div class=\"div-img\" style=\"\">有些有人间皮，有些就是直接觉醒之后很瑟，随你喜欢，如果你格子够，你绝对的可以全收集！！</div><div class=\"div-img\" style=\"\"><br style=\"\"></div><div class=\"div-img\" style=\"\"><div contenteditable=\"false\" class=\"title-model-wrapper title1\" style=\"margin:0px1px10px;width:calc(100%-6px);background:rgb(0,182,79);\"><div contenteditable=\"true\" class=\"title-p\" style=\"font-weight:700;font-size:14px;width:auto;color:rgb(255,255,255);\"><span style=\"font-size:20px;\">5星</span></div></div></div></div><div class=\"div-img\" style=\"color:rgb(0,0,0);font-size:14px;\"><div class=\"div-img\" style=\"\"><img data-real=\"//cdnimg-v2.gamekee.com/images/www/1630429320445_20710809.jpg\" src=\"//cdnimg-v2.gamekee.com/images/www/1630429320445_20710809.jpg\" style=\"height:359px;width:384.17px;\" data-width=\"580\" data-height=\"542\"></div><br style=\"\"></div><div style=\"color:rgb(0,0,0);font-size:14px;\"><div class=\"div-img\" style=\"\">5星可能都不用说，LSP的探测器都已经知道了，但是没有关西，你喜欢的或者别人不喜欢呢？</div></div><div class=\"div-img\" style=\"color:rgb(0,0,0);font-size:14px;\"><br style=\"\"></div><div style=\"color:rgb(0,0,0);font-size:14px;\"><div contenteditable=\"false\" class=\"title-model-wrapper title2\" style=\"margin:0px1px10px;width:calc(100%-6px);background:rgb(221,252,255);\"><div contenteditable=\"true\" class=\"title-p\" style=\"font-weight:700;font-size:14px;width:auto;color:rgb(0,182,79);\"><span style=\"font-size:20px;\">光</span></div></div></div><div style=\"color:rgb(0,0,0);font-size:14px;\"><div class=\"div-img\" style=\"\"><div class=\"div-img\"><div class=\"div-img\"><div class=\"div-img\"><img data-width=\"948\" data-height=\"475\" data-real=\"//cdnimg-v2.gamekee.com/wiki2.0/images/w_948/h_475/202/27015/2023/3/16/226867.png\" src=\"//cdnimg-v2.gamekee.com/wiki2.0/images/w_948/h_475/202/27015/2023/3/16/226867.png\" style=\"width: 603.984px;\"></div><br></div><br></div><br></div><div class=\"div-img\" style=\"\"><br style=\"\"></div><div class=\"div-img\" style=\"\">别问为第一个是什么东西，建议去看看皮肤塔，你会有新发现！还有部分是RB皮肤天子也很好看！</div></div><div class=\"div-img\" style=\"color:rgb(0,0,0);font-size:14px;\"><br style=\"\"></div><div class=\"div-img\" style=\"color:rgb(0,0,0);font-size:14px;\"><br></div><div class=\"div-img\" style=\"color:rgb(0,0,0);font-size:14px;\"><div contenteditable=\"false\" class=\"title-model-wrapper title2\" style=\"margin:0px1px10px;width:calc(100%-6px);background:rgb(221,252,255);\"><div contenteditable=\"true\" class=\"title-p\" style=\"font-weight:700;font-size:14px;width:auto;color:rgb(0,182,79);\"><span style=\"font-size:20px;\">暗</span></div></div><br style=\"\"></div><div class=\"div-img\" style=\"font-size: 14px;\"><div class=\"div-img\" style=\"color: rgb(0, 0, 0);\"><div class=\"div-img\"><div class=\"div-img\"><div class=\"div-img\"><img data-width=\"822\" data-height=\"952\" data-real=\"//cdnimg-v2.gamekee.com/wiki2.0/images/w_822/h_952/202/27015/2023/3/16/428949.png\" src=\"//cdnimg-v2.gamekee.com/wiki2.0/images/w_822/h_952/202/27015/2023/3/16/428949.png\" style=\"width: 600.984px;\"></div><br></div><br></div><br></div><div class=\"div-img\" style=\"color: rgb(0, 0, 0);\"><br style=\"\"></div><div class=\"div-img\" style=\"color: rgb(0, 0, 0);\">老太婆的机车皮肤，你值得拥有！<br style=\"\"></div><div class=\"div-img\" style=\"color: rgb(0, 0, 0);\"><br style=\"\"></div><div class=\"div-img\" style=\"color: rgb(0, 0, 0);\"><div contenteditable=\"false\" class=\"title-model-wrapper title2\" style=\"margin:0px1px10px;width:calc(100%-6px);background:rgb(221,252,255);\"><div contenteditable=\"true\" class=\"title-p\" style=\"font-weight:700;font-size:14px;width:auto;color:rgb(0,182,79);\"><span style=\"font-size:20px;\">水</span></div></div><br style=\"\"></div><div class=\"div-img\" style=\"color: rgb(0, 0, 0);\"><div class=\"div-img\" style=\"\"><div class=\"div-img\"><div class=\"div-img\"><div class=\"div-img\"><img data-width=\"989\" data-height=\"640\" data-real=\"//cdnimg-v2.gamekee.com/wiki2.0/images/w_989/h_640/202/27015/2023/3/16/701649.png\" src=\"//cdnimg-v2.gamekee.com/wiki2.0/images/w_989/h_640/202/27015/2023/3/16/701649.png\" style=\"width: 620.984px;\"></div><br></div><br></div></div><div class=\"div-img\" style=\"\"><br></div><div class=\"div-img\" style=\"\">为什么会有男的？不不不你错了，人家里欧都穿女仆，<span style=\"text-decoration-line: line-through;\">他一定是个可爱的男孩子，</span>买爆！<br></div><div class=\"div-img\" style=\"\"><br style=\"\"></div><div contenteditable=\"false\" class=\"title-model-wrapper title2\" style=\"margin:0px1px10px;width:calc(100%-6px);background:rgb(221,252,255);\"><div contenteditable=\"true\" class=\"title-p\" style=\"font-weight:700;font-size:14px;width:auto;color:rgb(0,182,79);\"><span style=\"font-size:20px;\">木</span></div></div><br style=\"\"></div><div class=\"div-img\" style=\"\"><div class=\"div-img\" style=\"color: rgb(0, 0, 0);\"><div class=\"div-img\"><div class=\"div-img\"><img data-width=\"994\" data-height=\"749\" data-real=\"//cdnimg-v2.gamekee.com/wiki2.0/images/w_994/h_749/202/27015/2023/3/16/458003.png\" src=\"//cdnimg-v2.gamekee.com/wiki2.0/images/w_994/h_749/202/27015/2023/3/16/458003.png\" style=\"width: 624.984px;\"></div><br></div><br></div><div class=\"div-img\" style=\"color: rgb(0, 0, 0);\">希特莉嘿嘿~偶的希特莉嘿嘿~嘿嘿~新皮肤真棒~240红石不买是人？</div><div class=\"div-img\" style=\"color: rgb(0, 0, 0);\"><br style=\"\"></div><div class=\"div-img\" style=\"color: rgb(0, 0, 0);\"><div contenteditable=\"false\" class=\"title-model-wrapper title2\" style=\"margin:0px1px10px;width:calc(100%-6px);background:rgb(221,252,255);\"><div contenteditable=\"true\" class=\"title-p\" style=\"font-weight:700;font-size:14px;width:auto;color:rgb(0,182,79);\"><span style=\"font-size: 20px;\">火</span><span style=\"font-size:20px;\"></span></div></div></div><div class=\"div-img\" style=\"\"><div class=\"div-img\" style=\"color: rgb(0, 0, 0);\"><div class=\"div-img\" style=\"\"><div class=\"div-img\"><div class=\"div-img\"><div class=\"div-img\"><img data-width=\"996\" data-height=\"796\" data-real=\"//cdnimg-v2.gamekee.com/wiki2.0/images/w_996/h_796/202/27015/2023/3/16/249625.png\" src=\"//cdnimg-v2.gamekee.com/wiki2.0/images/w_996/h_796/202/27015/2023/3/16/249625.png\" style=\"width: 623.969px;\"></div><br></div><br></div><div class=\"div-img\">大头皮肤买买买！</div><br></div><div class=\"div-img\" style=\"\"><span style=\"font-size: 16px;\"><br></span></div><div class=\"div-img\" style=\"\"><span style=\"font-size: 16px;\">从日服千里眼可以知道，后面的天子都是很瑟的了，所以好好努力收集天子吧，如果很急，后者可以考虑入手初始号，直接抽卡，你说这些都是你老婆，赶紧抽！“你老婆真棒.jpg”</span><br></div></div><div class=\"div-img\" style=\"color: rgb(0, 0, 0);\"><span style=\"font-size:16px;\"><br></span></div><div class=\"div-img\" style=\"color: rgb(0, 0, 0);\"><span style=\"font-size:16px;\">有些人没有联动，那没办法啊，游戏又不复刻，只能期待下次的联动更瑟的天子了~</span></div><div class=\"div-img\" style=\"color: rgb(0, 0, 0);\"><span style=\"font-size: 16px;\"><br></span></div><div class=\"div-img\" style=\"color: rgb(0, 0, 0);\"><br></div><div class=\"div-img\" style=\"color: rgb(0, 0, 0);\"><div contenteditable=\"false\" class=\"title-model-wrapper title1\"><div contenteditable=\"true\" class=\"title-p\"><span style=\"font-size: 20px; color: rgb(255, 255, 0);\">特 别 版</span></div></div></div><div class=\"div-img\" style=\"\"><span style=\"font-size: 16px;\"><div class=\"div-img\"><div class=\"div-img\"><div class=\"div-img\"><img data-real=\"//cdnimg-v2.g